    "message": "Cursor bootstrap for #645 (#657)\n\n* chore(cursor): bootstrap issue #645 (run 38966470660-1)\n\n* feat(route-weights): publish per-agent capacity state in export schema v2\n\nEmit a capacity block from capacity.py's in-process snapshot so hosted\nkeepalive/intake can skip shed seats, and treat state/window/observed_at\nchanges as publish-worthy. Keeps every v1 key; historical v1 commits stay\nreadable via KNOWN_SCHEMAS.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(route-weights): shed-pool marker flips capacity state in one export\n\nCover the #645 acceptance path where a live capacity.build() after a\nSHED_DIR marker must shed that agent within a single export cycle.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
